cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ScienceLogo, please cite this repository."
title: "ScienceLogo: a language for scientific workflows in the AI era"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Riccardo
    family-names: Boero
    email: ribo@nilu.no
